Kami juga pamit.

537
00:36:24,881 --> 00:36:26,195
Apa perlu kuantar?

538
00:36:26,195 --> 00:36:28,535
Biarkan saja. Jangan merepotkan Hye On.

539
00:36:28,535 --> 00:36:30,115
Jangan menyusahkan Do Hyun.

540
00:36:30,115 --> 00:36:32,420
- Baik.
- Kami pergi.

541
