mengacaukan keadaan itu?

603
00:40:43,834 --> 00:40:44,707
Entahlah.

604
00:40:44,707 --> 00:40:47,909
Dua masalah terselesaikan
tanpa disadari. Mungkin begitu?

605
00:40:51,112 --> 00:40:52,113
